  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>Founded in 1886, Goldey-Beacom College (GBC) is a private university in Wilmington, Delaware, United States, offering you a suburban campus spread across 24 acres. The college is accredited by the Middle States Commission on Higher Education, and some of its programs are also accredited by the Association of Collegiate Business Schools and Programs (ACBSP) and the International Assembly for Collegiate Business Education (IACBE), ensuring you receive a high-quality education.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>At Goldey-Beacom College, you'll be part of a vibrant campus community, with students from around the world. The college hosts a variety of student organisations and engagement activities designed to enhance your student life. You can get involved in clubs focused on art, politics, culture, and more. Plus, the Mental Health &amp; Wellness Centre (MHWC) offers you professional mental health counselling, free of charge, to support your well-being during your time at college.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>At Goldey-Beacom College, you'll find 5 residence halls offering a range of living options. Each residence hall is fully air-conditioned, includes utilities and wireless internet access, and comes fully furnished, making your stay comfortable and convenient.&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><i>If you’re looking for budget-friendly accommodation options outside the campus, feel free to </i><a href=\"https://edvoy.com/app/\"><i>download our app</i></a><i> and check out the Stays feature!</i></p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Facilities",
      "value": "<p><strong>Library</strong><br><br>The Hirons Library and Learning Centre (HLLC) is located in the Jones Center, offering you access to a computer lab, an Academic Resource Centre, and a library. You’ll find a wealth of resources, including books and electronic materials. The library is designed to support all your research needs.&nbsp;<br><br><strong>Sports</strong><br><br>GBC offers you multiple sports facilities, including the Jones Center Gymnasium and the Jackson Athletic Complex. As part of the NCAA Division II, the college also provides intramural and recreational sports, so you can stay active and involved. Additionally, the newly expanded Fitness Centre offers a top-notch space for your fitness and wellness needs.&nbsp;<br><br><strong>Cafeteria</strong><br><br>The college offers newly renovated dining facilities as part of the campus amenities. The Lightning Cafe is the primary dining area, where you’ll find local favourites. Plus, you can also enjoy made-to-order items, giving you even more options to satisfy your cravings.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
  ],
